battleLog (or battleSession.log)
  → 各 entry から player 名を手がかりに reveal カードを抽出
  → playerName → selfRevealCards, opponent → opponentRevealCards
  → currentFlagCard (フラグホルダーのカード) と結合
  → selfActiveCards = (flagHolder === playerName ? [currentFlagCard, ...selfRevealCards] : selfRevealCards)
  → opponentActiveCards = (flagHolder === opponent ? [currentFlagCard, ...opponentRevealCards] : opponentRevealCards)
